          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The de-identified processed data, analysis scripts and materials for this study are available on DataverseNL (https://doi.org/10.34894/DHRHI1).\nThe group-level MRI data are available on Neurovault (https://neurovault.org/collections/14102/).\nWe are unable to make the raw data publicly available, given that participants not explicitly consented for sharing their (coded) raw data on a public repository.\nTo obtain these data, ethics committee approval and a data sharing agreement would be required. For any questions or additional material, please contact the corresponding author."
